{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16952","headline":"德宗皇帝挽歌词三首 三 · 武元衡","name":"德宗皇帝挽歌词三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻阊阖前，星拱北辰籙。\n今来大明祖，辇驾桥山曲。\n松柏韵幽音，鱼龙焰寒烛。\n岁岁秋风辞，兆人歌不足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}